WEBVTT

00:00:59.121 --> 00:01:01.501
and at the same time,
to be kind and thoughtful

00:01:01.525 --> 00:01:04.675
and considerate
in our relationships with others.

00:01:05.249 --> 00:01:07.337
This is the same mind that we depend upon

00:01:07.361 --> 00:01:10.833
to be focused, creative, spontaneous,

00:01:10.857 --> 00:01:14.531
and to perform at our very best
in everything that we do.

00:01:14.912 --> 00:01:18.512
And yet, we don't take
any time out to look after it.

00:01:19.013 --> 00:01:22.026
In fact, we spend more time
looking after our cars,

00:01:22.050 --> 00:01:24.033
our clothes and our hair than we --

00:01:24.057 --> 00:01:25.304
okay, maybe not our hair,

00:01:25.328 --> 00:01:26.329
(Laughter)

00:01:26.353 --> 00:01:27.803
but you see where I'm going.

00:01:28.127 --> 00:01:30.480
The result, of course,
is that we get stressed.